<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures end mostly higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures end mostly higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 27 - U.S. stock index futures ended mostly higher after a quiet afternoon. June S&amp;P 500s and several other indicies set fresh records, though action choppy in uncharted territory. Tech sector led gains despite moderate losses in T-bond futures. June S&amp;P ceiling seen next at 856.00, traders said.</p>
